-- The consolidation of the Assurance Law prints the same words (CONSOLIDATION-ONLY for the present text):
-- src:3085793:26 | ”בעל רישיון נותן שירותי תשלום יציבותי“ – מי שבידו רישיון נותן תשלום יציבותי כהגדרתו בסעיף 36ט לחוק הבנקאות (רישוי), התשמ״א–1981;
-- The words cite a licence by the name "רישיון נותן תשלום יציבותי" and cite s 36ט of the Banking (Licensing) Law for its definition. The term that the definition itself defines is "בעל רישיון נותן שירותי תשלום יציבותי", and the name it uses for the licence holds the word "שירותי", which the name in the citing words lacks.
-- The target. The consolidation of the Banking (Licensing) Law, the current revision, prints the heading of s 36ט and, among its definitions, one for a licence under the longer name (CONSOLIDATION-ONLY; the instrument that its heading tag names was not read):
-- src:3078251:631 | סעיף 36ט – הגדרות – פרק ד׳2 [תיקון: תשפ״ג]
-- src:3078251:644 | ”רישיון נותן שירותי תשלום יציבותי“ – רישיון כמשמעותו בסעיף 36יב;
-- The two deposited lines print the longer name and do not print the shorter one. The whole page of the Banking (Licensing) Law is not deposited.
`reference: the definition that cites s 36ט, in s 31(1)` MEANS
    `A cross-reference` WITH
        `the citing words are in` IS "the definition printed on page 366 of the Act, within s 31 (the current revision of the consolidation of the Assurance Law prints it at line 26)"
        `what the citing words name` IS "the licence that s 36ט of the Banking (Licensing) Law, 5741-1981 defines, under the name the citing words print"
        `the name as the citing words print it` IS "רישיון נותן תשלום יציבותי"
        `the name as the target prints it` IS "רישיון נותן שירותי תשלום יציבותי"
        `how many things the citing words name` IS 1
        `how many of them the target has under that name` IS 0
        `limb (a) was read from` IS `the consolidation only`
        `limb (b) was read from` IS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`

